<title>CANADA: Canada Sept advance Raw Materials Price Index up.</title>
<headline>Canada Sept advance Raw Materials Price Index up.</headline>
<dateline>OTTAWA 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The early estimate for Canada's raw materials price index is for a 2.1 percent rise in September from August, Statistics Canada said on Thursday.</p>
<p>    INDEXES			 Sept</p>
<p>    Mineral fuels		 +8.5</p>
<p>    Metals			  -2.1</p>
<p>    Vegetable and animal	-0.8</p>
<p>    Wood			    +0.4</p>
<p>    Index ex mineral fuels    -0.7</p>
<p>The early estimate is based on partial returns and other indicators.</p>
<p>(For more information from Statistics Canada, contact Paul-Romeo Danis at 613-951-3350.)</p>
<p>-- Reuters Ottawa Bureau 613-235-6745</p>
</text>
